{"code": 0, "msg": "成功", "data": {"id": 157010, "game_id": 1069, "entry_id": 104939, "uid": 81618, "type": 4, "title": "DC韩语速成-5、游戏界面", "tag": "2", "created_at": 1653449137, "updated_at": 1653796845, "updated_uid": 81618, "comment_at": 1673336801, "last_at": 1673336801, "comment_count": 4, "status": 1, "summary": "终于到了认识游戏文本的章节了。首先来认识一下游戏的标题。如图，看黑字，复习一下，“ㄷ”像“d”，“ㅔ”像“ye”的“e”，“ㅅ”像“s”，“ㅡ”像“zi、ci、si”的“i”，“ㅌ”像“t”，“ㅣ”像", "thumb": "//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/25/860303.PNG", "model_ids": "", "like_count": 4, "unlike_count": 0, "view_count": 7016, "is_top": 0, "content_type": 0, "is_del": 0, "del_at": 0, "del_uid": 0, "is_release": 0, "source": 1, "last_ip_area": "", "is_prohibit_reply": 0, "is_only": 0, "state": 0, "audit_uid": 0, "favorite_count": 0, "seo": "", "video": "", "vote_ids": "", "is_elite": 0, "is_admin": 0, "audit_state": 0, "chat_game_id": 0, "is_image_text": 0, "from_chat": false, "chat_top": 0, "entry_auto": 1, "audit_at": 0, "server_id": 0, "image_num": 0, "video_list": "", "is_emulator": 0, "editor_type": 0, "ignore_hot": false, "mj_quote_num": 0, "mj_task_id": 0, "limit_age": 0, "important_at": 0, "is_expired": 0, "last_like_at": 0, "version": "", "word_count": 0, "content_id": 157010, "content": "<div class=\"div-img\"></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\">终于到了认识游戏文本的章节了。</div><div class=\"div-img\">首先来认识一下游戏的标题。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><img data-real=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/25/860303.PNG\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/wiki2.0/images/1069/81618/2022/4/25/860303.PNG\"></div><div class=\"div-img\">如图，看黑字，复习一下，</div><div class=\"div-img\">“ㄷ”像“d”，“ㅔ”像“ye”的“e”，</div><div class=\"div-img\">“ㅅ”像“s”，“ㅡ”像“zi、ci、si”的“i”，</div><div class=\"div-img\">“ㅌ”像“t”，“ㅣ”像“i”，</div><div class=\"div-img\">“ㄴ”像“n”，连<span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">起来</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">读</span><span style=\"font-size: 0.37333rem;\">像“呆色体你”，就是英语“destiny”啦。</span></div><div class=\"div-img\">同样的，后面的黄字读起来像“叉衣儿的”，就是英语“child”啦，游戏中在很多地方会出现这个词。</div><div class=\"div-img\">韩语词汇中差不多有一成是这样的词。还有过半的汉字词，这种可以用替换成汉字的方法来理解，每个韩语字会有几个对应的汉字，基本都是读音相似的，这里仅列出常用的不同读音的部分。还标注了韩语罗马音转写，方便拼读和记忆。</div><div class=\"div-img\"><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title5\"><p contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\">面板</p></div><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div><span style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"></span></span></div><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">공격력：攻击力</span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">방어력：防御力</span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\">민첩성：敏捷性</span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">치명타：致命打</span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">공</span>&nbsp;/gong/：</span></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">攻</span>，共<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span>空<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span>恐，<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">控</span></div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">격</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;/</span><span style=\"\">gyeok</span>/：</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">格</span></span>，击</div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">력</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;/</span><span style=\"\">ryeok</span>/：<span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\">力</span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">방</span>&nbsp;/bang/<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">：</span></span></span></span>榜，方，防<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">，旁</span></div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">어</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">/eo/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">：</span></span></span>鱼，语，御</div></span></span></span></span><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">민</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>/min/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">：</span>民，敏</span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">첩</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>/<span style=\"\">cheop</span>/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">：</span>叠，捷，贴</span><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">성</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>/<span style=\"\">seong</span>/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">：</span></span></span></span></span></span></span>成<span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">，声，圣</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">，</span><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\">星</span>，性</div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">치</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>/chi/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">：</span>齿，炽，值，治，致，置</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">명</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>/<span style=\"\">myeong</span>/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">：</span>名，明，鸣，冥，铭，命</span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\"></span><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">타</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>/ta/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">：</span>打，堕，他，拖</span><br></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10.5pt;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">공격형：攻击型</span></span><br></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\">방어형：防御型</span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">구속형：拘束型</span><br></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">회복형：恢复型</span><br></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"\">보조형：辅助型</span><br></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">형</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</span>/<span style=\"\">hyeong</span>/：衡，形，型，萤</span><br></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">구</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">&nbsp;</span>/gu/：勾，龟，九，拘</span></span></span></span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，口</span><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">，求，区</span></div></span><span style=\"\"><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">속</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">sok/：属，束，速</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">회</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>/</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\">hoe/：恢，回</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">복</span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"></span></span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"\">&nbsp;</span>/</span>bok/：复，仆</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"div-img\" style=\"\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"color:rgb